OL,3,AAirbnb's divisive new house rules come 
OL,4,Ainto force                             
OL,6,FNew rules on what Airbnb hosts can     
OL,7,Freasonably ask guests to do have come  
OL,8,Finto force.                            
OL,10,FHosts should now not normally ask      
OL,11,Fguests to wash up, for example, but can
OL,12,Fappeal to Airbnb if they have a        
OL,13,Fcompelling reason.                     
OL,15,FSome guests have found lists of house  
OL,16,Frules laborious to complete, with one  
OL,17,Ftelling the BBC "it was not relaxing at
OL,18,Fall".                                  
OL,20,FBut some hosts have said that the costs
OL,21,Fof paying for extra cleaning may have  
OL,22,Fto be passed on to customers.          
